flowchart TD
    A[Build heap of arrival ship id candidate entries] --> B[heapify the entries]
    B --> C[Record inputs step]
    C --> D{Heap not empty}
    D -->|yes| E[heappop smallest entry]
    E --> F{Static skip reason}
    F -->|yes| G[Zero seats and skip with the static reason]
    F -->|no| H[Take quoted seats whole or min of allocatable and remaining]
    H --> I{Seats greater than zero}
    I -->|yes| J[Record pick step]
    I -->|no| K[Record skip as not chosen]
    G --> D
    J --> D
    K --> D
    D -->|no| L[Record result with seats and remaining demand]
